{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"title":"DiscoveredEvent","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent.swift#L54","fileName":"DiscoveredEvent.swift"},"externalID":"s:6Events15DiscoveredEventV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An event type found in the running program: one declared with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":", or one of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library’s own events, with its schema.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema\/Enumeration"],"generated":true,"title":"Events","anchor":"Events"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DiscoveredEvent"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists every one the program links, from every module, so a store or a tracking plan"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be built from it with no list to keep: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DatabaseStore(database:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan()"},{"type":"text","text":" each use it."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","DiscoveredEvent.all.map { $0.type.name }","\/\/ [\"ApplicationBackgrounded\", ..., \"SessionStarted\", \"signed_up\"]"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" struct is discovered, wherever it is declared, unless it is generic or nested in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a generic type, as neither can hold the record "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" places in the binary; the macro notes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each one where it is declared. One declared in an extension of a generic type doesn’t compile."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The library’s own events are discovered too: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ControlActivated"},{"type":"text","text":" and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Application"},{"type":"text","text":" events of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LifecycleTracking"},{"type":"text","text":", once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"their modules are linked. An event that conforms to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" by hand, without "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":", isn’t:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list it beside the discovered ones, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DiscoveredEvent.all.map(\\.type) + [Legacy.self]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Limits","text":"Limits","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An object file in a static archive that nothing references brings no record into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"program: the linker leaves it out. That happens with CocoaPods’ static libraries, a static"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"XCFramework, or a Bazel library with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alwayslink = False"},{"type":"text","text":". SwiftPM, and Bazel’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alwayslink = True"},{"type":"text","text":", link every object file. Link such a library whole ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-force_load"},{"type":"text","text":" on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Apple platforms, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"--whole-archive"},{"type":"text","text":" on Linux) to have its events found."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" holds the events of the images loaded when it is called: the program and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dynamic libraries it links. A library opened later with "},{"code":"dlopen","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" adds its events from then on."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A library that loads or unloads while ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is read is either read whole or left out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that read. On Apple platforms one that dyld adds before the read starts is found; on Linux a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"dlopen","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"dlclose","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" waits for the read, so the library is missed. The next read sees it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Don’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlclose"},{"type":"text","text":" a library that declares events while the process runs. On Apple platforms"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dyld keeps it mapped and its events are still found. On Linux the loader unmaps it while the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Swift runtime keeps its types registered, and the process can crash later. Keep plug-ins"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open, or open them with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RTLD_NODELETE"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A module that declares events, linked into two images, lists each of its events twice, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores and plans refuse the duplicate. Link each such module into one image.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two events of one name in one linked image, the modules linked statically into one executable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or library, fail to build: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" gives each record a symbol named for the event’s name,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which the compiler or the linker refuses to define twice. Separate images are never compared,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a name shared with a dynamic library, a library opened with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dlopen"},{"type":"text","text":", or a module linked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into two images is found only here, and a store or plan built from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" refuses it. So is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one declared inside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"private"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fileprivate"},{"type":"text","text":" type, whose symbol is local to its file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/schema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/type"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventSchema/Enumeration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema\/Enumeration","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enumeration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EventSchema.Enumeration","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventschema\/enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enumeration","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The raw values a property of a raw-value enum is written as: the enum’s name, its raw value’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type and, where they are known, every case’s raw value.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DiscoveredEvent/schema":{"abstract":[{"text":"The event’s schema.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/schema","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schema","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent\/schema","title":"schema","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/ConsentCategory":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentCategory"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsentCategory"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/consentcategory","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The purpose an event is collected for, which the user consents to or refuses: analytics,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"advertising and the like."}],"title":"ConsentCategory"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"title":"Events","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events"},"doc://Events/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Event":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Event"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something that happened, recorded as a typed value."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/event","title":"Event"},"doc://Events/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DiscoveredEvent/all":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"all"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events15DiscoveredEventV","text":"DiscoveredEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Every event type the program links, ordered by the UTF-8 bytes of their names, then by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version, then by the types’ fully qualified names.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent\/all","title":"all"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventSchema":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The shape of an event type: its name, its schema version, its consent category and its stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties in declaration order, as a value tooling reads.","type":"text"}],"title":"EventSchema","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventschema","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DiscoveredEvent/type":{"abstract":[{"text":"The event’s type.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/type","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"type","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Event","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events5EventP"},{"text":" & ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Codable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7Codablea"},{"text":").Type","kind":"text"}],"title":"type","url":"\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent\/type","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DiscoveredEvent":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent","title":"DiscoveredEvent","type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An event type found in the running program: one declared with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":", or one of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library’s own events, with its schema."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"}}}